OL,3,ATom Felton: I'm so excited to see
OL,4,ARupert Grint play Ron Weasley again
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery night on Broadway, Tom Felton
OL,7,Fwalks on stage to a roar from the
OL,8,Faudience. He had expected the reaction
OL,9,Fto die down after the first week, but
OL,10,Fit never did.
OL,12,FAlmost 15 years after his final
OL,13,Fappearance as Draco Malfoy on screen,
OL,14,FFelton has spent the past 10 months
OL,15,Fplaying the character again in the
OL,16,FBroadway production of Harry Potter and
OL,17,Fthe Cursed Child.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
