OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATom Felton: I'm so excited to see
OL,4,ARupert Grint play Ron Weasley again
OL,5,
OL,6,FI meet the actor in a dressing room at
OL,7,FNBC Studios, just off Times Square in
OL,8,FNew York. He's just finished a live
OL,9,Ftelevision appearance and in a few
OL,10,Fhours will be back on stage for his
OL,11,Fnext performance.
OL,13,FHe greets me with a hug and says he is
OL,14,Fexcited to speak to BBC News because
OL,15,Fhis mum and 100-year-old grandfather
OL,16,Fwill see it. His family are some of his
OL,17,Fbiggest supporters - his mum has seen
OL,18,Fthe show five times already, while his
OL,19,Fdad is due to visit next month.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
